Description: Rust core + Tcl scripting AI agent framework
 Veles is an agent runtime with a Rust engine and a Tcl scripting
 surface. It speaks the OpenAI chat-completions and Responses wire
 protocols, runs tools, and executes untrusted code behind one of five
 sandbox backends (native safe-interp, podman, systemd-nspawn,
 firecracker microVM, FreeBSD jail).
 .
 Recommends carry real capability: without tk8.6 there is no desktop
 GUI, without git no checkpoints, without ripgrep a slower search tool.
 Suggests are the sandbox backends and the Tk image decoders — veles
 degrades and says so rather than failing.
